    keyword507: "Self-check precautions:\r\n1. Please ensure all connections are installed correctly and the drainpipe is connected to the floor drain.\r\n2. Before testing, place the robot back on the station and make sure it is charging.\r\n3. Do not remove the robot from the station during the test.\r\n4. Do not power off the station during the test.\r\n5. The mop will get wet during the self-checking of auto water refill and drain kit.",
